# Day 21 - Digital Privacy Intelligence Dashboard

## Objective

Built an interactive privacy intelligence dashboard that analyzes a user's digital footprint and estimates privacy exposure.

## Tools Used

- Claude AI
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Chart.js

## Key Features

- Digital Footprint Score
- Privacy Score
- Exposure Heatmap
- Company Exposure Ranking
- Data Collection Matrix
- Risk Radar
- Digital Twin Profile
- Privacy Improvement Simulator

## Key Learnings

- Digital services collect different categories of data.
- Ecosystem concentration increases privacy risks.
- Visual dashboards improve privacy awareness.
- Interactive analytics make risk assessment easier.

